  "catalogueCode": "CCX-2222-TWB5",
  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>An ocean world locked to the red companion, carrying a belt of permanent convective storm around the substellar point and calm macrotidal flats on either flank. The storm belt has not stopped since observation began and is not expected to. Everything that lives here is built for shear, and the settlements sit behind stone in the lee of low ridges. It is one of two worlds in the register with contact recorded as reciprocal, and the register is quietly proud of it.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    },
    {
      "value": "<p>Oceanski svet s stalnim nevihtnim pasom in izjemno velikim plimskim razponom.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "sl-SI"] }]
    }
  ],
